    "host_activity": "The shared benchmark lock serialized accelerator experiments. Other CPU jobs were active on this development Mac; both measured trials per arm are included.",
    "ranking": "One frozen stock query embedding per query, eight held-out labeled queries per NanoBEIR sample. Scores compare each query against its own 96 sampled documents.",
